WEBVTT

0
00:00:00.209 --> 00:00:01.210
Key takeaways

1
00:00:01.899 --> 00:00:04.280
If you take anything from this training today,

2
00:00:04.519 --> 00:00:06.079
let it be the following.

3
00:00:06.619 --> 00:00:07.250
First,

4
00:00:07.619 --> 00:00:10.000
always consult with your local HR partners

5
00:00:10.180 --> 00:00:14.119
to support and guide you as you consider compensation information for your team.

6
00:00:14.420 --> 00:00:15.010
Second,

7
00:00:15.319 --> 00:00:17.629
you don't need to be an expert in compensation.

8
00:00:17.899 --> 00:00:19.739
Do your best to understand the basics

9
00:00:19.739 --> 00:00:22.409
to support transparent and informed conversations.

10
00:00:22.540 --> 00:00:22.979
Third,

11
00:00:23.450 --> 00:00:26.409
It's your responsibility to protect sensitive information and

12
00:00:26.409 --> 00:00:28.950
handle compensation and other employment data with care.

13
00:00:29.129 --> 00:00:32.840
If you have any questions about handling sensitive information,

14
00:00:33.209 --> 00:00:35.189
consult with your local HR team.

15
00:00:36.139 --> 00:00:36.759
Overall,

16
00:00:37.180 --> 00:00:37.889
when in doubt,

17
00:00:38.130 --> 00:00:40.240
reach out to your local HR partner.